  "releaseNotes": "Improves connection integrity and resilience: push notifications dispatch through a bounded background queue with DroppedPushCount, server-error and protocol diagnostics are bounded and sanitized, runtime session-changing commands are rejected on shared connections, cluster node connects reserve capacity and no longer inherit caller cancellation or deadlines, ambiguous ASKING failures surface as ValkeyAskingException without replay while keeping the connection usable, and script recovery runs only for exact NOSCRIPT cache-miss messages.",
